      "raw": "[quote=\"bluedarky\"]\n\nThe rule for drawing two cards during your draw phase is literally “if you have not played a card or used a power before your draw phase you may draw 2 cards.”\n\n[/quote]\n\nThis sounds nitpicky, but it really does matter; it should be \"if you have not played a card or used a power before your draw phase you may draw <em><strong>an additional</strong></em>&nbsp;card\" (so that effects that allow an additional card draw during Draw phrase stack).\n",
